  "idea": "Jellyfin: self-host your own private media streaming server for free",
  "text": "Stop paying for cloud video storage when you can stream your media for free. Video agencies burn hundreds monthly on tiered Vimeo plans just to share client drafts. Commercial platforms compress footage quality, cap viewer traffic, and lock features behind enterprise paywalls. Jellyfin transforms your local drive into a private streaming server with custom logins and zero subscriptions. You stream high-definition assets anywhere with zero recurring costs.",
